<title>DENMARK: ISS wins Swedish elderly care contract.</title>
<headline>ISS wins Swedish elderly care contract.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish cleaning group ISS-International Service System A/S said its ISS Care Service unit in Sweden on Monday secured a 150 million Swedish crown contract to run two care centres for the elderly and handicapped.</p>
<p>It said the three-year contract with the local authorities covered the running of homes in the Stockholm area and that at the same time ISS Care Service acquired another home for the elderly in the district for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>-- Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
